==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*2 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Ururun Wolf (Enemy)|Ururun Wolf]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**2 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.
**1 [[Lutrinae Gokurakko]] spawns.
**1 [[Dolphina]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**1 [[Winged Pigge]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Dolphina, Winged Pigge, Gokurakko, and Ururun all at the same time seems like, and is, absolute hell. Until Bahamut Talents arrived.

Use the startoff to build up your wallet, then hit the base. Lure Dolphina to your base, and then use Bahamut to blow up both Dolphina and the Angelic Gory. This won't kill Gokurakko though, so kill it quickly using [[Bubble Cat]] and [[Mushroom Cat]]. Once that's over with, you've got a basic Winged Pigge and Ururun fight that's doable by spamming Ramen, [[Hitman Cat]], Bubble, and [[Awakened Doron]].

